  "body": "Fixes #7751.\n\n`bin/check-opencode-metered-providers.mjs` read only `process.argv[2]`; a second config path, an unknown flag, or a nonexistent second path were silently ignored and the guard reported success for the first file alone (verified probe in #7751: `good.jsonc bad.jsonc` exited 0 while the deepseek-selecting bad config was never read).\n\nChange: `main()` now rejects any argument beyond the single optional config path with a usage error (exit 2, naming the extra argument) before any file is read. Zero/one-argument behavior, messages, and exit codes are unchanged.\n\nTests: new subprocess regression test in `bin/check-opencode-metered-providers.test.mjs` covering the single-config controls (pass 0 / fail 1), an extra positional (exit 2), and an unknown flag (exit 2). Suite: 18/18 on the branch; the new test fails against the pre-fix script (17 pass / 1 fail).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796746533&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7752&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7752&signature=3ae47e4657e9b4309b55d1ae7631ff9b88d4fcfa3f6075de2158fb2282ec18f5\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7752?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
